The company highlights precision and care in every build, positioning its work as a way to elevate the comfort and style of a living space. The personalized commission model is presented as the primary differentiator, enabling one-of-a-kind results that reflect each client''s personal taste.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Personalized Commission Service", "Custom Furniture Design", "Artisan Home Goods"], "industries": ["Residential furniture", "Home decor"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": [], "facts_used": ["Honey Brook, Pennsylvania location -> db", "Custom furniture and home accents -> /", "Personalized commission service -> /", "Custom furniture design and artisan home goods -> /", "Precision and care emphasis -> /", "Tailored pieces reflecting personal style -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We build custom furniture and one-of-a-kind home accents.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='s-c-hopkins-woodworking' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='SAI Advanced Power Solutions is headquartered in Franklin Park, Illinois, with additional campuses in St. Charles and a distribution center in Carol Stream. The company operates as an end-to-end manufacturer of advanced power distribution solutions.

The company designs and manufactures low-voltage switchgear (UL 1558, UL 891), medium-voltage switchgear (5 kV–38 kV), DC switchgear, custom power distribution units (PDUs), and proprietary platforms such as Profusion™—an all-in-one PDU with sectionalized main disconnect, K-rated transformer, and integrated metering—and EVention™, a BABA-compliant power distribution platform for EV charging. Services span engineering design, system optimization, startup and commissioning, field measurement and retrofit, preventative maintenance, training, and power-quality monitoring. A new production center, three times the size of the previous facility, supports both custom and high-volume production.

SAI serves telecommunications, renewable energy integration, hydrogen generation, battery energy storage, and energy consulting sectors. Its market-focused business units target mission-critical facilities, original equipment manufacturers (OEMs), commercial/industrial/government clients, emerging markets, and aftermarket support.

The company emphasizes “future-ready” innovation, citing patented products, a Teaming for Customer Success (TCS) program, and a supply-chain transformation that expanded manufacturing capacity.', certifications=ARRAY['UL Listed','BABA compliant']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Low voltage switchgear manufacturing (UL 1558, UL 891)", "Medium voltage switchgear manufacturing (5kV\u201338kV)", "DC switchgear manufacturing", "Custom power distribution unit (PDU) manufacturing", "Engineering design and system optimization", "Startup and commissioning", "After-market support", "Power quality monitoring and energy management", "Field measurement and retrofit", "Preventative maintenance", "Training services"], "industries": ["Telecommunication", "Renewable Energy Integration", "Hydrogen Energy Generation", "Battery Energy Storage Systems", "Energy Consultants"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["End-to-end manufacturer of advanced power distribution solutions", "Patented product portfolio including Profusion\u2122 and EVention\u2122", "New world-class production center 3X larger than previous facility", "Teaming for Customer Success (TCS) initiative"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Franklin Park, Illinois -> db", "Additional campuses in St. Charles and Carol Stream, Illinois -> /", "Manufacturer of end-to-end advanced power distribution solutions -> /", "Products: low voltage switchgear (UL 1558, UL 891), medium voltage switchgear (5kV\u201338kV), DC switchgear, custom PDUs -> /", "Profusion\u2122 all-in-one PDU platform with sectionalized main disconnect, K-rated transformer, advanced metering -> /", "EVention\u2122 EV charging power distribution platform, BABA compliant -> /", "Services: engineering design, system optimization, startup and commissioning, field measure and retrofit, preventative maintenance, training, power quality monitoring -> /, /services", "Market-focused business units: Mission Cri