UPDATE companies SET description='Sailor Plastics operates a manufacturing facility in Adrian, Minnesota, producing PET and LDPE plastic bottles and containers for a range of packaging applications. The company emphasizes domestic production, with all bottles made in the USA at its Adrian site.

