UPDATE companies SET description='Selby Electric operates from Mandan, North Dakota, serving Bismarck, Mandan, and the surrounding Burleigh and Morton counties. The business is owned and operated by Craig Selby, a North Dakota Master Electrician (license #M4002) with over 30 years of hands-on experience in residential and commercial electrical work.

